    "He doesn't even give you the chance to make a decision, as he teleports you to the room where you sleep."

# game/rutas/labelsact2.rpy:174
translate ingles menupreguntas_septem2_e75266d1:

    # "{sc=3}Heh, para la próxima podríamos llamarlo buen chico y ver como reacciona.{/sc}"
    "{sc=3}Heh, next time we could call him a 'good boy' and see how he reacts.{/sc}"

# game/rutas/labelsact2.rpy:175
